      "statement": "After adapter admission, TalonHost derives a provider-qualified conversation root and agent conversation ID, serializes work per root, replaces an active turn with a newer one, and builds AgentRequest authority-bearing fields from host-controlled route, selection, and callback state rather than adapter metadata.",
